From 28f151ede1a31333e7aac0bb63a66bebf63e1c15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jgrizon
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:47:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shader: a translation records whether its 32-lane halves are
 exact (VICTORY_BUILDER_EXACT, off by default)

HostShader::inexact_halves names the read across the halves answered from
the reader's own half, or the LDS left unordered between them (none: exact);
checked in the lowering where halves_local decides it, cached with the
translation, and logged per shader by shader_cache.

Generated by Mistral Vibe.

Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
